    "note": "HSE sub-tab label pluralising the CAPA (Corrective and Preventive Action) initialism with a bare English \"-s\". Sibling locales show the initialism is genuinely handled per language: several attach their own plural morphology instead of the English one (et: CAPA-d, fi: CAPA:t, hr: CAPA-e, ky: CAPAлар, tr: CAPA'lar, fil: Mga CAPA), and kk translates the expansion outright (Түзету/алдын алу шаралары). The listed locales, including ru, simply left the untouched English plural form and still need real localisation."
  },
